WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Twelve minutes. Can you make room for them?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Not to chase a miracle. Just to observe.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
A schedule is measurable.
A miracle needs proof.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
The seller describes four listening styles:
guided voice, music, nature and white noise.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Try the free routine before buying anything.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Read the evidence. Decide for yourself.
